Minimal project has been added here to the Audio Mic Record Demo https://github.com/goatchurchprime/godot-demo-projects/tree/gtch/micplayback
This gives the option of using the AudioStreamPlaybackMicrophone class if it exists.  

Since the `get_microphone_buffer()` function returns a `PackedVector2Array` I have to convert it to the WAV bytes using the following code.

```GDScript
recording = AudioStreamWAV.new()
var data = PackedByteArray()
data.resize(4*len(chunks)*chunksize)
for j in range(len(chunks)):
	for i in range(chunksize):
		var k = 4*(j*chunksize + i)
		var frame = chunks[j][i]
		var fl = int(frame.x*32767)
		var fr = int(frame.y*32767)
		data[k] = (fl & 255)
		data[k+1] = ((fl >> 8) & 255)
		data[k+2] = (fr & 255)
		data[k+3] = ((fr >> 8) & 255)
recording.data = data
```
